                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Transcript of telegram from Marquis of Salisbury to
                        Sir L. West, dated May</hi> 1, 1888.</head>
                <p>The Government of Newfoundland have not forbidden sale of bait to American
                    vessels; several have been already supplied and licenses therefore are
                    unnecessary.</p>
